@startuml UC6_ShuffleRepeat
title UC6: Toggle Shuffle/Repeat - Use Case Specification

skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFFCC
left to right direction

actor User

rectangle "UC6: Toggle Shuffle/Repeat" {
    usecase "Toggle Shuffle" as Shuffle
    usecase "Toggle Repeat" as Repeat
}

User --> Shuffle
User --> Repeat

note right of Shuffle
  **Pre-conditions:**
  - Có tracks trong queue
  
  **Post-conditions:**
  - Queue được shuffle hoặc restore
  - PlayerState.shuffleEnabled updated
  - UI icon thay đổi
  
  **Main Flow (Enable Shuffle):**
  1. User click Shuffle button
  2. View gọi AppController.toggleShuffle()
  3. PlaybackController lưu originalOrder
  4. PlaylistManager randomize queue
  5. PlayerState.setShuffleEnabled(true)
  6. UI highlight Shuffle icon
  
  **Alternative Flow (Disable Shuffle):**
  A1. Shuffle đang enable:
      1. PlaylistManager restore originalOrder
      2. PlayerState.setShuffleEnabled(false)
      3. UI un-highlight Shuffle icon
end note

note right of Repeat
  **Pre-conditions:**
  - Player đã khởi tạo
  
  **Post-conditions:**
  - Repeat mode thay đổi
  - PlayerState.repeatMode updated
  
  **Main Flow (Cycle Through Modes):**
  1. User click Repeat button
  2. View gọi AppController.toggleRepeat()
  3. PlaybackController đọc current mode
  4. Cycle: OFF → REPEAT_ALL → REPEAT_ONE → OFF
  5. PlayerState.setRepeatMode(newMode)
  6. UI icon thay đổi theo mode
  
  **Repeat Modes:**
  - OFF: Không repeat
  - REPEAT_ALL: Repeat toàn bộ playlist
  - REPEAT_ONE: Repeat bài hiện tại
end note

@enduml
